{"ticker":"GPIL","symbol":"GPIL","instrumentId":3099237,"name":"Godawari Power & Isp","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Godawari Power & Ispat Ltd. is an Indian steel manufacturer with an integrated approach to steel production. The company’s operations include mining, production of sponge iron, steel billets, and wire rods, as well as captive power generation. With facilities located in central India, Godawari Power serves various industries, including infrastructure, construction, and manufacturing. In addition to its steel products, the company generates power through waste heat recovery and solar plants, promoting sustainability in its operations. Godawari Power is known for its focus on innovation, operational efficiency, and a commitment to delivering high-quality steel products to both domestic and international markets.","website":"www.godawaripowerispat.com","location":"Raipur, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:22:58.867Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":228.4,"changePct":3.2736480376198274,"week52High":305.85,"week52Low":190.74},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹15,383 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹6,132 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"249,199,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"167"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"65,490,301"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.44%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.42"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.2"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"4.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.19"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"19.26"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"3–24"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"13.8%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"17.24"},{"label":"Volume","value":"832,131"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,409,214"},{"label":"Master score","value":"43"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"26"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"37"},{"label":"Group rank","v